00:28:49.090 --> 00:28:51.424
And I stole this, I think-
We talked about

738
00:28:51.424 --> 00:28:52.257
that last time.

739
00:28:52.257 --> 00:28:54.973
Yeah I stole this from my collaborator, Steve.

740
00:28:56.440 --> 00:29:01.440
The first leg is modern science and empirical studies.

741
00:29:01.660 --> 00:29:02.820
So what is happening

742
00:29:02.820 --> 00:29:07.820
in rigorous, methodology sound, experiments that is true.

743
00:29:09.720 --> 00:29:12.310
The second leg is ancient wisdom in history.

744
00:29:12.310 --> 00:29:15.640
So what have people been talking about for millennia

745
00:29:15.640 --> 00:29:17.660
and what patterns and themes are there?

746
00:29:17.660 --> 00:29:20.050
And then the third leg is daily practice.

747
00:29:20.050 --> 00:29:22.070
So when I go out and coach people,

748
00:29:22.070 --> 00:29:25.137
or when I put on my reporting hat and ask people,

