00:29:25.137 --> 00:29:26.980
"Well, Hey, what kind of tools you use?

750
00:29:26.980 --> 00:29:29.760
What works and what doesn't?" that's daily practice.

751
00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:32.170
And in this book, for anything to make it in there,

752
00:29:32.170 --> 00:29:35.040
it had to be able to stand on all three of those legs,

753
00:29:35.040 --> 00:29:36.300
because I'm interested in

754
00:29:36.300 --> 00:29:38.740
what I call truth with a capital T:

755
00:29:38.740 --> 00:29:41.930
so principles, concepts, skills,

756
00:29:41.930 --> 00:29:45.400
that are gonna work for most people in most circumstances.

757
00:29:45.400 --> 00:29:46.460
(music plays softly)

