01:41:45.690 --> 01:41:49.470
because the unhealthy extreme of this is either

2591
01:41:49.470 --> 01:41:50.888
the TMI-
Yep.

2592
01:41:50.888 --> 01:41:52.650
Or performative vulnerability,

2593
01:41:52.650 --> 01:41:54.040
which is a huge-
That's the other thing,

2594
01:41:54.040 --> 01:41:56.470
the performative vulnerability, which we see a lot of,

