01:42:08.660 --> 01:42:09.630
more followers-
It's a good marketing,

2604
01:42:09.630 --> 01:42:10.991
on social media-
marketing strategy. Yeah.

2605
01:42:10.991 --> 01:42:15.583
Yeah. And, and that I get asked that question sometimes.

2606
01:42:15.583 --> 01:42:17.930
And the way that I like to think about it in my own life

2607
01:42:17.930 --> 01:42:22.080
is vulnerability should very rarely feel good in the moment,

2608
01:42:22.080 --> 01:42:24.360
