01:44:26.440 --> 01:44:27.790
I tend not to be able to go deep

2661
01:44:27.790 --> 01:44:31.280
cause the last thing I wanna do is feel compressed for time.

2662
01:44:31.280 --> 01:44:33.425
So I'm fortunate that in a conversation like this,

2663
01:44:33.425 --> 01:44:36.170
I feel like I have the time to,

2664
01:44:36.170 --> 01:44:39.857
but ultimately like it's just a memory of like a lot of pain

2665
01:44:39.857 --> 01:44:42.270
and I think healthy healing is

2666
01:44:42.270 --> 01:44:45.380
there's gotta be some distance between how painful that was.

2667
01:44:45.380 --> 01:44:47.260
Cause otherwise it'd be hard to get through the day.

2668
01:44:47.260 --> 01:44:48.093
Sure.

2669
01:44:48.093 --> 01:44:48.930
So I also think that's probably

2670
01:44:48.930 --> 01:44:51.200
a sign of like good recovery,

2671
01:44:51.200 --> 01:44:54.550
is intellectualizing it enough,

2672
01:44:54.550 --> 01:44:55.970
but not so much that now

