01:45:30.620 --> 01:45:35.620
I think the first thing is community is not efficient.

2691
01:45:37.260 --> 01:45:42.260
It is not "optimal," or productive in the short term.

2692
01:45:42.810 --> 01:45:44.990
Cause building community is slow.

2693
01:45:44.990 --> 01:45:49.030
It takes time and the best, deepest,

2694
01:45:49.030 --> 01:45:52.140
